WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Dugu Qiu was defeated by the listing of 100 beef noodles on the trading floor

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Beef noodles? This one is delicious, not to mention that all three are cost-effective.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I have to grab a few packs quickly

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Sorry, you can't buy. The other party has blacklisted you.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
He blocked me? Why?

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Just because I said the toast tastes bad? That's not fair

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:28,550
Come on, I'm in a third-class vehicle zone

8
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:31,900
I can't catch it even if I hit my head.

9
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,900
Dear survivors

10
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,900
Tomorrow will be the first official copy of Survival World

11
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,900
The name of the copy is Send me home quickly

12
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,900
Take me home quickly

13
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,900
I remember that the challenge of this copy is not high

14
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,900
But the difficulty is that there are many hidden rules

15
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,900
After entering the instance, a survivor will be randomly assigned a passenger.

16
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,900
Successfully delivered the passenger to the designated location

17
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,900
It means the customs clearance is successful

18
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,900
Copy introduction completed

19
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:50,900
Good luck to you tomorrow
